1.4 Scope

The framework includes the following major components:

Raw Data Processing
Previous Raw Data Management
Staging Layer
History Layer
Snapshot Layer
Daily Logging Framework
Final Logging Framework
Retry Mechanism
Parallel Processing Framework
Audit Framework
Backfill Processing
Timezone Management
Error Handling
Performance Optimization

1.5 Technology Stack
Component	Technology
Platform	Microsoft Fabric
Storage	Lakehouse
Language	PySpark
Processing Engine	Apache Spark
Catalog	MHMR_LAKEHOUSE
Data Format	Delta Tables
Programming Language	Python
Parallel Processing	ThreadPoolExecutor
Logging	Custom Audit Tables
Versioning	SCD Type 2
Snapshot	CDC-Based Snapshot Framework


